  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your mastery of fighting styles allows you to emulate fighting styles on the fly.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Combat Style Master<sup>UC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> By spending 1 point of mythic power you gain the benefit of one combat style feat you do not possess and may enter it as a free action. You must be able to meet the prerequisites of this style feat. This additional combat style feat lasts for one round per mythic tier.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-a-m-feats#toc47\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
